application form for recognition as PSIA, the PSIA would be liable for
penal action under Foreign Trade (Development & Regulation) Act, 1992,
as amended, in addition to suspension/ cancellation of recognition.', 'Indha Responsibility and Liability of PSIA and Importer section-la, 2.53 Responsibility and Liability of PSIA and Importer
(a) In case of any mis-declaration in PSIC or mis-declaration in the online
application form for recognition as PSIA, the PSIA would be liable for
penal action under Foreign Trade (Development & Regulation) Act, 1992,
as amended, in addition to suspension/ cancellation of recognition.', '2.53 Responsibility and Liability of PSIA and Importer
