scheme-shipping bill on which benefit of that scheme has not been availed, in
accordance with the Regulations under Customs Act, 1962, and exporter would be
entitled to benefit under scheme in which shipment is subsequently converted.', 'Indha Conversion of Shipping Bill from one Scheme to another section-la, 2.73 Conversion of Shipping Bill from one Scheme to another
