towards discharge of export obligation. Shipping Bills with relevant Scheme
Code as per Customs Notification need to be endorsed with the Diamond
Imprest Authorization Number, to establish co-relation of exports with the DIA
issued.', '[56]', '["and", "The", "iii", "Cut", "One", "not", "DIA", "FTP", "are", "vii", "may", "per", "only", "with", "each", "more", "than", "must", "Para", "this"]', 'Support Conditions of Imports & Exports processing and compliance validation.', '["4.96", "Conditions of Imports & Exports", "business-rule", "document-driven", "dgft"]');
