conditions as BOA may decide.', 'Indha Change of Location / Inclusion of Additional Location with BOA section-la, Change of Location / Inclusion of Additional Location with BOA explains the operating rule set that DEKAI should enforce. Key control points include 6.35 Change of Location / Inclusion of Additional Location with BOA
