Approval
BOA may consider change of location of EOU / EHTP / STP / BTP unit from place
mentioned in Lo P to another and / or to include additional location outside
territorial jurisdiction of original DC / Designated Officer, subject to such
conditions as BOA may decide.', '[20]', '["BOA", "may", "EOU", "STP", "BTP", "and", "with", "EHTP", "unit", "from", "such", "place", "Change", "decide", "another", "include", "outside", "Officer", "subject", "Location"]', 'Provide knowledge guidance for Change of Location / Inclusion of Additional Location with BOA.', '["6.35", "Change of Location / Inclusion of Additional Location with BOA", "business-rule", "dgft"]');
INSERT INTO rules (rule_id, section_code, rule_text, rule_type, trigger_text, condition_text, validation_text, action_text, exception_text, output_text) VALUES ('CH6-SEC6_35-R001', '6.35', '6.35 Change of Location / Inclusion of Additional Location with BOA
Approval
