diversion to Weapons of Mass Destruction (WMD) or in missile system or military
use (including by terrorists and non-state actors), he shall apply for a SCOMET
authorisation.');
INSERT INTO workflows (section_code, step_index, step_text) VALUES ('10.05', 10, 'Run validation: Note: “Military use” shall mean incorporation into items listed under SCOMET
Category 6 or for the use, development, or production of military items listed in
this category.');
INSERT INTO workflows (section_code, step_index, step_text) VALUES ('10.05', 11, 'Run validation: Exporter who is going to export/transfer such items regulated under Catch-all
Controls is required to obtain a SCOMET license from DGFT.');
