v.');
INSERT INTO conditions (section_code, condition_text) VALUES ('10.19', 'Any individual/firm should initially notify the Directorate General of Foreign
Trade (DGFT) immediately after an export violation is discovered and
confirmed internally, and then conduct a thorough review of all such trade
activities where a violation is suspected.');
INSERT INTO conditions (section_code, condition_text) VALUES ('10.19', 'If there is confirmation from the relevant enforcement agencies such as
