declaration type = REX and SFZ(with inter-gateway movement without
storage) except for seastore permits application.');
INSERT INTO exceptions (section_code, exception_text) VALUES ('7', 'a) For all Declaration Types except GTR, BKT, SFZ (with inter-
gateway movement), REX, specify Party Type:
- (Declarant)
- (Declaring Agent, if declared by Agent)
- (Inward Carrier Agent; optional for transport mode = 2, 3, 5 or
7)
- (Importer)
- (Freight Forwarder; optional)
